---
import Shot from '@/components/site/Shot.astro'
import Card from '@/components/site/Card.astro'
import SectionHead from '@/components/site/SectionHead.astro'
import Home from '@/components/app/Home.astro'
import Usage from '@/components/app/Usage.astro'
import DoneWhen from '@/components/app/DoneWhen.astro'
import ModelPicker from '@/components/app/ModelPicker.astro'
---
<section class="wrap section" id="product">
  <SectionHead title="Built to be handed work" note="Each task gets a brief, a plan, and a record of what it read, changed and ran." />
  <div class="grid">
    <Card title="Sorted by what needs you" href="/features/approvals">
      <Shot sky="sand" label="Home: two tasks waiting on you, an approval and a question, above your workspaces and this week's totals." desktop={{ w: 592, h: 460, x: 44, y: 36, s: 0.84 }} phone={{ w: 350, h: 260, x: 18, y: 20, s: 0.49 }}>
        <Home />
      </Shot>
      <Fragment slot="body">Home lists the approvals and questions from every running task. Allow or deny a command right there, or open the task that asked.</Fragment>
    </Card>
    <Card title="See what it cost" href="/features/usage">
      <Shot sky="slate" label="Usage for the last seven days: 23 tasks, 8.6M tokens, $4.12 estimated spend, 90% finished and 92% of changed files kept, with spend per day." desktop={{ w: 592, h: 460, x: 59, y: 32, s: 0.74 }} phone={{ w: 350, h: 260, x: 34, y: 18, s: 0.44 }}>
        <Usage />
      </Shot>
      <Fragment slot="body">Usage shows tasks, tokens and estimated spend per day, how much changed work you kept, which models did the work, which tools failed, and which edits never had a passing check.</Fragment>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Checks its own work" href="/features/task-record">
      <Shot sky="sage" label="A finished task: its result, the files it changed, all three Done when checks met with their evidence, and a receipt with time, tokens and cost." desktop={{ w: 592, h: 460, x: 16, y: 38, s: 0.8 }} phone={{ w: 350, h: 260, x: 10, y: 16, s: 0.47 }}>
        <DoneWhen />
      </Shot>
      <Fragment slot="body">Write what done looks like. The agent marks each line met or not met with the evidence it saw, and the receipt shows the time, tokens and cost.</Fragment>
    </Card>
    <Card title="Uses the model you trust">
      <Shot sky="fog" label="The model picker: your providers on the left, Anthropic's models with context size and price on the right, and the effort below." desktop={{ w: 592, h: 460, x: 36, y: 30, s: 1 }} phone={{ w: 350, h: 260, x: 14, y: 16, s: 0.6 }}>
        <ModelPicker />
      </Shot>
      <Fragment slot="body">Eleven providers on your own keys or cloud credentials, any OpenAI-compatible endpoint including Azure OpenAI, or local models through Ollama. Pick the mode and the effort for each task.</Fragment>
    </Card>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section { padding-top: var(--section-gap); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 48px 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 639px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 36px; } .section { gap: 28px; } }
</style>
